.el .ds Aq '
.TH sam-jail-menu 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-menu \- Show, hide or restore unsandboxed menu entries for a sandboxed app
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail menu\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIACTION\fR> <\fIAPP\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show, hide or restore unsandboxed menu entries for a sandboxed app
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIACTION\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
list: List unsandboxed menu entries that start this app\*(Aqs AppImage
.IP \(bu 2
hide: Hide them (SAM\*(Aqs sandboxed launcher stays)
.IP \(bu 2
restore: Put back the entries SAM hid
.RE
.TP
<\fIAPP\fR>

